       "id": "69f0e6f5836d28f995cba0df",
       "headline": "India's Jio Platforms posted operating revenue of INR 449.2 billion for its fourth quarter ended 31 March 2026, which represents an increase of 12.6 percent year-on-year. Quarterly net profit was INR 79.3 billion, up 13 percent year-on-year, while EBITDA jumped 17.9 percent to INR 200 billion.",
       "event_type": "earnings",
       "role": "primary",
       "domain": "jio.com",
       "published_at": "2026-04-28T03:30:00",
       "url": "https://www.telecompaper.com/news/jios-quarterly-profit-jumps-13-tops-524-million-subscribers-in-march--1569276",
       "publisher": "telecompaper.com",
       "title": "Jio's quarterly profit jumps 13%, tops 524 million subscribers in March"
      },
      {
       "id": "69f0e5d4d32561089420a6c5",
       "headline": "For the year ended March 31, 2026, the company’s net profit increased to Rs 300.53 billion in FY26, from Rs 261.2 billion in FY25. The revenue from operations was recorded at Rs 1.46 trillion as compared to Rs 1.28 trillion in the previous year.",
       "event_type": "earnings",
       "role": "primary",
       "domain": "jio.com",
       "published_at": "2026-04-27T05:53:50",
       "url": "https://tele.net.in/reliance-jio-releases-financial-results-for-qe-and-year-ended-march-31-2026/",
       "publisher": "tele.net.in",
       "title": "Reliance Jio releases financial results for QE and year ended March 31, 2026 -"
      },
      {
       "id": "69efaab8a84b609af2b2f005",
       "headline": "Jio Platforms reported a 13% year-on-year rise in net profit for the fourth quarter of FY26, reflecting steady growth in its telecom and digital services business. Profit after tax stood at ₹7,935 crore, compared to ₹7,022 crore in the same quarter last year. Revenue also saw a healthy uptick, rising to ₹38,259 crore.",
       "event_type": "earnings",
       "role": "primary",
       "domain": "jio.com",
       "published_at": "2026-04-25T17:45:36",
       "url": "https://techstory.in/jio-platforms-q4-profit-rises-13-arpu-growth-remains-limited-without-tariff-hike/",
       "publisher": "techstory.in",
       "title": "Jio Platforms Q4 Profit Rises 13%, ARPU Growth Remains Limited Without Tariff Hike - TechStory"
      },
      {
       "id": "69efa902a84b609af2b1a715",
       "headline": "Reliance Jio reported a net profit of Rs 7,935 crore in Q4 FY26.",
       "event_type": "earnings",
