      },
      {
       "id": "69efaa49727212302c5eafc5",
       "headline": "In the January–March quarter, the group’s digital spearhead reported revenue of Rs 44,929 crore, up 12.7 per cent year on year, while profit after tax rose 13 per cent to Rs 7,935 crore.",
       "event_type": "earnings",
       "role": "primary",
       "domain": "jio.com",
       "published_at": "2026-04-25T00:00:00",
       "url": "https://indiantelevision.com/iworld/reliance-jio-races-ahead-in-fy26-as-profit-tops-rs-30000-crore/",
