       "title": "Reliance Jio races ahead in FY26 as profit tops Rs 30,000 crore"
      },
      {
       "id": "69efa9e08a54b8f07c95aca9",
       "headline": "Jio Platforms Ltd, the group’s telecommunications and digital arm, reported revenues of ₹38,259 crore in Q4, up 13% compared to last year. Ebitda expanded by a healthy 18% to ₹20,060 crore.",
       "event_type": "earnings",
