      {
       "id": "69efaa11727212302c5e8736",
       "headline": "For FY26, the company reported 14.7% increase in revenue from operations to ₹1.72 trillion. Its net profit for the full year was at ₹30,053 crore, a growth of 15%. Ebitda for the full year rose 19% to ₹76,255 crore.",
